This repository contains a simplified version of the ACES 1.2 configuration
(OCIO v1), with the addition of the Sharp RGB color space in the `rendering`
role, and support for the Khronos PBR Neutral tone mapper.

Disclaimer: This configuration is provided as-is, without guarantees of any
kind. Before using it, please ensure that it behaves as you would expect. If
you encounter any errors, feel free to open an issue.

--- Original readme: ---

This repository contains all the default color configurations, for use with
OpenColorIO.

Visit opencolorio.org for additional information.

